			<div class="content" id="post-content-4137666">
									

<p>Its a fantastic build-up from describing a normative company to 2 paragraphs down the line describing the exact anomaly in question. Normally, I feel perturbed when writers withhold the exactness or the hints at something anomalous requiring a monolith like the Foundation to cover it up, but that does not apply when the execution is so good.</p>
<p>Yours was well executed. Especially when playing on the theme of old-timey aristocracy melding with modern-day hierarchies and business culture. Reminds me of those fringe stories and rituals you hear every so often about CEOs eating only sardines to conserve their omega 3 intake or eating McDonalds meals before or after a transaction.</p>
<p>+10 if I could.</p>

